In what order are these lines printed, first to last?

```js
setImmediate(() => {
  console.log('immediate 1');
  process.nextTick(() => console.log('tick inside immediate 1'));
  Promise.resolve().then(() => console.log('promise inside immediate 1'));
});
setImmediate(() => console.log('immediate 2'));
console.log('sync');
```

In what order are these lines printed, first to last?

```js
setTimeout(() => {
  console.log('timeout');
  setTimeout(() => console.log('timeout in timeout'), 0);
  setImmediate(() => console.log('immediate in timeout'));
  process.nextTick(() => console.log('tick in timeout'));
}, 0);
console.log('sync');
```

